1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,101
Welcome to Miftah.

2
00:00:01,101 --> 00:00:04,404
In this tutorial you will sign in, find
your

3
00:00:04,404 --> 00:00:07,706
way around the navigation, switch the
interface to Arabic

4
00:00:07,706 --> 00:00:11,009
and back, review your profile, and sign
out safely.

5
00:00:11,009 --> 00:00:12,844
Start on the sign-in page.

6
00:00:12,844 --> 00:00:15,413
Enter the email address and password your

7
00:00:15,413 --> 00:00:17,982
administrator gave you, then select Sign
In.

8
00:00:17,982 --> 00:00:20,917
Never use another person’s account, and do
not

9
00:00:20,917 --> 00:00:23,486
save a password on a shared computer.

10
00:00:23,486 --> 00:00:26,422
Miftah opens the home page for your role.

11
00:00:26,422 --> 00:00:29,725
Your role is shown under your name at the

12
00:00:29,725 --> 00:00:32,660
top right; this account is a Company
Admin.

13
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,963
The organisation you are working in, Oasis
Crest Properties,

14
00:00:35,963 --> 00:00:39,266
is shown at the top of the side panel.

15
00:00:39,266 --> 00:00:42,569
The rail on the left holds the main areas:

16
00:00:42,569 --> 00:00:45,504
Home, Leasing, Collection, Accounting,
Operations, Settings, and More.

17
00:00:45,504 --> 00:00:49,174
Each person sees only the areas their role
allows, so

18
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:52,844
a Property Manager or a Tenant sees a
shorter menu.

19
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:53,578
Select Leasing.

20
00:00:53,578 --> 00:00:57,247
The side panel now lists its pages:
Tenancy Contracts, Tenants,

21
00:00:57,247 --> 00:01:00,550
Properties and Units, and Enquiry, with
pinned views underneath.

22
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:02,752
Now select AR in the header.

23
00:01:02,752 --> 00:01:06,789
The labels change to Arabic, and the whole
layout mirrors from

24
00:01:06,789 --> 00:01:10,825
left-to-right to right-to-left, with the
rail moving to the right-hand side.

25
00:01:10,825 --> 00:01:13,027
Select EN to return to English.

26
00:01:13,027 --> 00:01:15,596
Next, open the menu under your name.

27
00:01:15,596 --> 00:01:18,899
It shows your email address, Update
Profile, and Logout.

28
00:01:18,899 --> 00:01:20,000
Select Update Profile.

29
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,302
My Profile shows your name, email address,
and role.

30
00:01:23,302 --> 00:01:25,871
You can correct your full name or

31
00:01:25,871 --> 00:01:28,073
phone number and select Save Changes.

32
00:01:28,073 --> 00:01:31,009
Only an administrator can change your
email address.

33
00:01:31,009 --> 00:01:33,210
The Password card holds Change Password.

34
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:36,513
Use a unique password, and never share it
in

35
00:01:36,513 --> 00:01:39,449
a ticket, a note, or a screen recording.

36
00:01:39,449 --> 00:01:42,385
Finally, open the menu again and select
Logout.

37
00:01:42,385 --> 00:01:45,687
The protected pages close and the sign-in
page returns.

38
00:01:45,687 --> 00:01:48,623
At the end of every session on a

39
00:01:48,623 --> 00:01:51,192
shared device, log out the same way.
